    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Current Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> LAN and Online multiplayer, with a global server browser<br></li><li> 5 first-party maps<br></li><li> 6 Primary weapons, plus sidearms<br></li><li> 12 Throwable weapons<br></li><li> 16 Gear items<br></li><li> Full spectating features with data capture sockets<br></li><li> Strafe-jumps, wall kicks, ramp jumps, and double-jumps, including skiing down slopes<br></li><li> High-performance netcode allowing comfortable play up to 140ms<br></li><li> Skin/model customization and drops</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upcoming Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hub maps for practicing jumps, socializing, and arranging matches<br></li><li> 7 additional Gangs<br></li><li> Full single-player campaign<br></li><li> Jump modes<br></li><li> Ingame ranking</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/2a688e38b4b9b4930c87f7aa5fdabb98.avif?t=1710430326\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/b763e0ed18b7bf7e6e9cd2bf9e3885b1.poster.avif?t=1710430326\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/b763e0ed18b7bf7e6e9cd2bf9e3885b1.webm?t=1710430326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/b763e0ed18b7bf7e6e9cd2bf9e3885b1.mp4?t=1710430326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The weapons in Midnight Guns hit different. Literally. Six primary firearms with unique knockback, armor penetration, and blood loss characteristics give you the right tool for every situation. Not enough for you? No worries, every level is scattered with throwables, from ninja stars to bundles of dynamite to cans full of snakes. Even when your mag is dry, deadly force is always at your fingertips.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/67fd719e8b4b9523f63d982fc75f160f.avif?t=1710430326\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/1e90b65f3ae473661ea0450855ba6296.poster.avif?t=1710430326\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/1e90b65f3ae473661ea0450855ba6296.webm?t=1710430326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/1e90b65f3ae473661ea0450855ba6296.mp4?t=1710430326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Equip yourself with a wide variety of passive Gear in order to put pressure on your opponents, or else respond effectively to their own schemes. Kevlar? Check. Laser sights? Check. Automatic immolation on every throwable weapon? Count on it. The list is expanding all the time, and the tactics are always fresh.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/9060cdbfc2f7a9dd480b024562343b5c.avif?t=1710430326\" /></div><br>Above all else, high-fidelity tactical gameplay is paramount. Enjoy high framerates, steady frametimes, and effective latency correction to make sure every shot feels just like it should.",
