 mag is dry, deadly force is always at your fingertips.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/67fd719e8b4b9523f63d982fc75f160f.avif?t=1710430326\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/1e90b65f3ae473661ea0450855ba6296.poster.avif?t=1710430326\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/1e90b65f3ae473661ea0450855ba6296.webm?t=1710430326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/1e90b65f3ae473661ea0450855ba6296.mp4?t=1710430326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Equip yourself with a wide variety of passive Gear in order to put pressure on your opponents, or else respond effectively to their own schemes. Kevlar? Check. Laser sights? Check. Automatic immolation on every throwable weapon? Count on it. The list is expanding all the time, and the tactics are always fresh.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877600/extras/9060cdbfc2f7a9dd480b024562343b5c.avif?t=1710430326\" /></div><br>Above all else, high-fidelity tactical gameplay is paramount. Enjoy high framerates, steady frametimes, and effective latency correction to make sure every shot feels just like it should.",
